{
 "encounter_id": "01004",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "FAMILY_MEMBER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My tummy hurts. Every day. Well, not every day. Mostly school days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Hi, doctor, I'm Dana, Leo's mum. It's been about a month, and it's always before school, he's fine at the weekend."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hey Leo. Imagine your tummy and your brain share one phone line. When the brain is busy, the tummy picks up the call. Does that sound silly? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit. But kind of true. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Where on your tummy does it hurt?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Here. Around the middle. Or maybe lower. It moves."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you feel sick?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah. Not sick sick. Sort of sick."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He's never actually thrown up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mum, you're saying no vomiting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Right, no vomiting."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blood in his poo?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Leo, do you get headaches too?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sometimes. No, wait, yes. A lot. In the afternoon."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And are you tired?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not really. Okay, a bit, after football."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is there anything about school that's on your mind?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Well. Maths, with the timed tests. They make my tummy go funny."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He said that to me in the car for the first time this morning. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for telling me, Leo. Mum, what is he taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "1 sachet of Movicol, once a day, for the constipation. Cetirizine, 5 mg, in the evenings for hay fever. And vitamin D drops, 400 units, daily."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Maybe nuts. At nursery, he came up in a rash after a snack. They never worked out which one."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll note that as possible and unconfirmed. Any other history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "The constipation, the hay fever, and eczema when he was little."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Has he had any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Grommets at three. And his tonsils at six."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anyone in the family get headaches or tummy troubles?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "His mum, me, I get migraines."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What year are you in, Leo?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Year four."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you play anything?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Football, Saturdays. I'm a goalie."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And who's at home?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mum, dad and Max, my brother. He's annoying."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you drink during the day?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Squash. Not much water."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Temperature 36.7, pulse 88, weight 30 kilos.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is that okay? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Perfect. Leo, lie on the couch and I'll press your tummy. Tell me if it hurts.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tickles. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The tummy is soft and not tender anywhere, even when I press deeply."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He never flinches. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And there's no swelling or lumps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Can I get up? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "In a second. Any cough or wheeze?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble when he wees?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "No, nothing, it's all normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm not going to give this a name today. What I'd like to try is a plan. First, drink water, at least four glasses a day, and keep the Movicol going."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He hates water. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I don't hate it. I just forget it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Put a bottle in his bag, with a sticker he picks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Good idea. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Second, we talk to school about the timed maths tests, so Leo isn't dreading Monday mornings."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll email the teacher tonight. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Third, a small breakfast, even toast, before school."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the aches are still there after two weeks of this plan, come back and we'll look again."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Two weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
